edits_description = "The image was cropped, the text was removed, and some of the land was replaced with more water."
final_image_tex = SubResource("Resource_jg17w")
province = 59
blurb = "Depicts women washing clothes in the Chōfu river in Musashi province (present-day Tōkyō and Saitama area).

Chōfu is one of the Six Crystal Rivers (\"mu tamagawa\"), which are a theme covered by several ukiyo-e artists.

The inset in the top left depicts flowering bush clover over another of the jewel rivers, the Noji Jewel River in Ōmi Province."
